      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/man-la-yahduruhu-al-faqih:4:164:1",
      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/34/1/164/5700",
      "text": [
        " اَلرَّجُلِ يُسْلِمُ عَلَى اَلْمِيرَاثِ قَالَ \"إِنْ كَانَ قُسِمَ فَلاَ حَقَّ لَهُ وَ إِنْ كَانَ لَمْ يُقْسَمْ فَلَهُ اَلْمِيرَاثُ\" قَالَ قُلْتُ اَلْعَبْدُ يُعْتَقُ عَلَى مِيرَاثٍ فَقَالَ \"هُوَ بِمَنْزِلَتِهِ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5700 - Muhammad ibn Abi Umayr narrated from Aban ibn Uthman from Muhammad ibn Muslim from Abu Abdullah (as) regarding a man who accepts Islam for the sake of inheritance.\nImam (as) said: \"If the inheritance has already been divided, then he has no right to it. But if it has not been divided, then he is entitled to the inheritance.\"\nI asked: \"What about a slave who is freed for the sake of inheritance?\"\nImam (as) said: \"He is in the same position.\""
        ]
      }
    },
